+# eframe is declared twice on purpose: `accesskit` and `android-native-activity` are mutually
+# exclusive in eframe (`compile_error!("`accesskit` feature is only available with
+# `android-game-activity`")`), and the Android shell has to enable the NativeActivity backend.
+# Cargo applies features only from target tables whose cfg matches, so the desktop keeps accesskit
